{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，美羽学姐果然很厉害……”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4765", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没想到她已经注意到我们的事了。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉我纠结这么久好像笨蛋……”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4766", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪虽然叹气，但表情很温和。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至今为止一直没办法说出口的关系。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐拯救了纱凪的心。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个人的祝福让纱凪从束缚中解脱了。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也想成为像学姐那样的人……”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4767", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？你是想说我没办法吗？”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4768", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是那样。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而是纱凪是纱凪，美羽学姐是美羽学姐。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这我知道……可是还是憧憬啊。想成为那样的人……”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4769", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果被美羽学姐那样的人告白，新吾也会高兴的吧？”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4770", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为、为什么？是那个美羽学姐喔！如果我是男的，立刻就摇着尾巴跟她走了。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4771", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪其实是喜欢美羽学姐啊。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你真的不感兴趣？”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4772", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个软绵绵、疗愈系、胸部也很大的最强的美羽学姐？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4773", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为对我来说最强的是纱凪。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你就这么喜欢我？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4774", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喜欢喔，喜欢到受不了。……现在也是一直在忍耐着。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住说出了真心话。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“别、别忍耐了，直接亲我就好啊。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6928", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我说的“忍耐”纱凪理解成亲吻的样子。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且我已经是新吾的了，还客气会很奇怪吧，或者说……”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4776", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……被新吾强硬对待，还挺心动的。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4777", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，不是我希望你对我强硬，只是说偶尔那样也不错……”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4778", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪红着脸慌张解释。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……就算知道她以为是接吻，但我的理性也差点被破坏殆尽。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正因为如此……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，但是今天我想对你温柔。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4779", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我坐在秋千上吻了她的脸颊。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是雨点般温柔、轻巧。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她脸颊的热度和一瞬间的紧张都让我满心怜爱。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不要只有脸颊。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4780", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4781", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我静静地贴上她的唇，回应她可爱的索吻。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是身体太紧绷吗？身旁秋千的链子发出声响。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……笨蛋，温柔过头了。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4782", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我说过了，今天想要这样。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的脚都没力站不起来了。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4783", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我公主抱你回家吧？”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，这也很吸引人……”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4784", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果你有其他提案的话。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4785", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，在能站之前就在这里聊聊吧。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4786", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样也能跟新吾多待一会♪”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4787", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是那样……”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、等……喂！现在又亲的话，我会一直站不起来啦！”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4788", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾、等……嗯────！？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4789", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果我还是没能忍耐，夺走了纱凪的唇。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能克制自己不要吻太久。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……新吾其实比我更像亲吻魔吧……”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6929", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得不是。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么你就是喜欢强硬地夺走我的唇……？”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6930", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那不是纱凪喜欢的吗？”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是偶尔啦！偶尔！”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6931", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然不讨厌……虽然喜欢……刚才的吻真的、让人心跳好快……”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6932", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪真是个亲吻魔呢。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊啊啊，我又说了多余的话自掘坟墓……！”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6933", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "等到纱凪能自己站起来时，天色已经暗下来了。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“冷静一想，好不甘心。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4791", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不甘心？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我明明那么讨厌男人，却因为被吻了就腿软……”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4792", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这是怎么回事？”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4793", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太可爱了真是困扰。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4794", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我注意到纱凪又用想接吻的眼神看我的唇。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抓紧我。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4795", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我扶着纱凪的腰，开始了不知是第几次的亲吻。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瞬间，纱凪就腿软得攀在我身上。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就说接吻……不行了，笨蛋新吾……”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4796", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的？”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……唔……”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6934", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我直视着她问，纱凪的视线慌张地移开了。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唔～”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6935", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过最后还是抬起水汪汪的眼睛看我。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要负起责任喔。把我变成这样……”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4798", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为你每天亲吻我，每天都让我站不起来，让我变成没用的女人……”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4799", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那是让你变成更没用的女人的意思吗？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那……”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "sn6938", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我会负责的。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等、等一下，就说亲吻……啊……”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4800", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾，到这里就好了。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4801", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，我真的把纱凪公主抱送回来了。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“时间拖得有点晚了。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，公主抱好厉害……”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4802", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……嗯……没有实际被抱过我想是不会懂的……”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4803", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“腿软的时候被那样抱……感觉……真的只能说很厉害……”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4804", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然把纱凪放下来了，但她仍贴着我没有分开。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看到这样的我大家会笑出来吧。我自己也觉得很扯……”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4805", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事，不会笑的。大家都那么祝福我们。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不是说社团的人。而是班上的同学们……”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4806", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这么在意周围的眼光？”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我之前总是跟班上的女生说‘瓜生哪里好？’或者‘会说那种人好真是不敢相信’……”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4807", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那的确会在意周围的目光。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是我觉得没关系喔。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4808", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟纱凪都和以前不同了。喜欢上纱凪，让我往好的方向改变了。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我相信今后也会继续改变。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以没必要在意周围的眼光。让大家看着今后的我们就好了。”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4809", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以说，再一次。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊、等等……笨蛋，公主抱是……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4810", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊啊，不能让人看到……笑得这么暗爽的我不能让人看到！”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "_sn4811", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
